---
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<section id="agendar" class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-28 text-center">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[40px] border border-white/20 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#DB1FFF]/20 via-neutral-950 to-neutral-950 px-8 py-20 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(219,31,255,0.25)]">
    <!-- Ambient Radial Glow -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#DB1FFF]/30 blur-3xl"></div>

    <p class="inline-block rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#DB1FFF] mb-4">
      ¿Listo para escalar tus consultas?
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-outfit mx-auto max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl">
      Mostrate donde ya te buscan y <span class="text-[#DB1FFF]">agendá más pacientes</span> hoy.
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-base text-white/70">
      Dejá de perder tiempo contestando mensajes sueltos y empezá a recibir pacientes confirmados directamente en tu calendario.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
      <a
        href={SITE.bookingUrl}
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-4 rounded-full bg-white/15 p-2 pl-8 pr-2 text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-white backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#DB1FFF] hover:bg-white/25 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(219,31,255,0.5)] hover:scale-105"
      >
        <span>Agendá tu consultoría gratuita</span>
        <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#DB1FFF] text-white transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:translate-x-1 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(219,31,255,0.7)]">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
